_out/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Video runs. Each frame json embeds its frame as base64, so a 124-frame clip is
# ~235 MB of output; that cannot go in a repo. The entity table is kept, because it
# is small and is the record of every identity decision:
#   output/<stem>/tracks.json
# Everything it indexes has to be regenerated with run_video.sh.
output/*/frames/
output/*/ov/
output/*/preview.mp4

# One-off batch fixups for a specific delivered run (see tmp/). Not pipeline code.
tmp/
